{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Reborn Warrior: Chronicles</u></strong> is a non-linear visual novel with TowerDefence elements, set in a world full of mystery and magic. The game tells about a guy who dies and is reborn, and from that moment his new journey begins. His goal is to gain the upper hand over 8 states and their main lords. Who will he be to them: friend, foe or lover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849480/extras/ef1346cf4d8c52ff3fdc501efa68d5b2.avif?t=1757426251\" width=800 height=314 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting plot that will be presented in different genres from horror to comedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear chapters where every choice affects the outcome of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different endings, from death to deep friendship or even love relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TowerDefence, which is mechanically linked to how you progress through the novella</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>18+ content is present, which is disabled in the settings</u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849480/extras/70dcfdb243e1cb172581be31b831718b.avif?t=1757426251\" width=800 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After passing the prologue you will be opened one of the 8 locations of the novella. But don't hurry to choose the path, because to open the location you need to go through a series of levels in Tower Defense mechanics, collecting stars, which you will need to pass the novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TowerDefence Card Collection:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each choice you make in the game will lead to a different ending, these in turn lead to the collection of unique cards that will affect your tactics in the game. Cards can be neutral or powerful, granting passive or active skills that can be used in battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849480/extras/e8875bf42c03bb90fad2a8384033fc51.avif?t=1757426251\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains sexually explicit scenes, including erotic dialog, innuendo and visuals of intimate content. In addition, the game contains scenes of violence and cruelty (blood, injuries, psychological pressure).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content is intended exclusively for adult audiences (18+). <u>If you wish, you can disable sensitive scenes in the game settings.</u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3849480?t=1757426251","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849480/1a60660923eaca7a03eb9277628517827808dd85/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757426251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849480/2fb480f66688856fe086ecd26b2d9d33d36ebe69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757426251","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849480/2fb480f66688856fe086ecd26b2d9d33d36ebe69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757426251","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence and brutality, as well as scenes of a sexual nature, which can be turned off in the settings."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Reborn Warrior: Chronicles</u></strong> is a non-linear visual novel with TowerDefence elements, set in a world full of mystery and magic. The game tells about a guy who dies and is reborn, and from that moment his new journey begins. His goal is to gain the upper hand over 8 states and their main lords. Who will he be to them: friend, foe or lover?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849480/extras/ef1346cf4d8c52ff3fdc501efa68d5b2.avif?t=1757426251\" width=800 height=314 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting plot that will be presented in different genres from horror to comedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear chapters where every choice affects the outcome of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different endings, from death to deep friendship or even love relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TowerDefence, which is mechanically linked to how you progress through the novella</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>18+ content is present, which is disabled in the settings</u></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849480/extras/70dcfdb243e1cb172581be31b831718b.avif?t=1757426251\" width=800 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After passing the prologue you will be opened one of the 8 locations of the novella. But don't hurry to choose the path, because to open the location you need to go through a series of levels in Tower Defense mechanics, collecting stars, which you will need to pass the novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TowerDefence Card Collection:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each choice you make in the game will lead to a different ending, these in turn lead to the collection of unique cards that will affect your tactics in the game. Cards can be neutral or powerful, granting passive or active skills that can be used in battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849480/extras/e8875bf42c03bb90fad2a8384033fc51.avif?t=1757426251\" width=800 height=299 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains sexually explicit scenes, including erotic dialog, innuendo and visuals of intimate content. In addition, the game contains scenes of violence and cruelty (blood, injuries, psychological pressure).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content is intended exclusively for adult audiences (18+). <u>If you wish, you can disable sensitive scenes in the game settings.</u></p>","developers":["PurrPixel Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849480/a03f1313f966a64b3baa3278ee3391bb08418f8b/header.jpg?t=1757426251","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Reborn Warrior: Chronicles","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP/Vista/7/8/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  512MB+</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP/Vista/7/8/10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz Dual Core<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  512MB+</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"lin